// Title: Sysinternals PsSuspend Suspicious Execution
// Rule ID: 4beb6ae0-f85b-41e2-8f18-8668abc8af78
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1562.001
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
